OL,3,CBail refused for man accused over
OL,4,Crooftop stand-off with police
OL,6,FBail has been "most firmly refused"
OL,7,Ffor a man accused of having been in a
OL,8,Frooftop stand-off with police in north
OL,9,FBelfast.
OL,11,FA number of cars were damaged and a
OL,12,Fpolice officer was injured after a man
OL,13,Fclimbed on to a roof in Lepper Street
OL,14,Fin the New Lodge area in the early
OL,15,Fhours of Tuesday.
OL,17,FPatrick John Paul Harmon, 42, of
OL,18,FHillman Street, appeared at Belfast
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday morning.
OL,26,@nD@OOUnD@cO]
