PN,41102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785417510
OL,3,CBail refused for man accused over
OL,4,Crooftop stand-off with police
OL,6,FHe faces 14 charges including assault
OL,7,Fof three police officers.
OL,9,FThe charges also include assault
OL,10,Fagainst two other named people and
OL,11,Fcriminal damage against cars and
OL,12,Fproperty, exposure and possession of
OL,13,Fan offensive weapon described as a
OL,14,Fknife.
OL,16,FA police officer indicated they
OL,17,Fbelieve they can connect the accused
OL,18,Fto the charges.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
