PN,41103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785417510
OL,3,CBail refused for man accused over
OL,4,Crooftop stand-off with police
OL,6,FThey told the court the defendant was
OL,7,Fapprehended by police after falling
OL,8,Foff the roof, and arrested.
OL,10,F"During interview he admitted to
OL,11,Fthreatening police with a knife,
OL,12,Fstating he was trying to get them to
OL,13,Fback away," they said, adding that he
OL,14,Fdenied the assaults.
OL,26,@rD@AOUuD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
