FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785417510
OL,3,CBail refused for man accused over
OL,4,Crooftop stand-off with police
OL,6,F"When talking about the police
OL,7,Finteraction, he admitted to wilfully
OL,8,Fcausing damage to police cars and
OL,9,Fthrowing tiles at officers in an
OL,10,Fattempt to injure them, saying, 'If
OL,11,Fthey weren't behind a shield, they
OL,12,Fwere fair game'."
OL,14,FPolice opposed bail saying there was a
OL,15,Frisk of reoffending, risk of harm to
OL,16,Fthe public, and that they did not
OL,17,Fbelieve he could be managed on bail.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
