FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785417510
OL,3,CBail refused for man accused over
OL,4,Crooftop stand-off with police
OL,6,FA defence lawyer said his client felt
OL,7,Fhe was being "wrongly taken by the
OL,8,Fpolice as he had done nothing wrong",
OL,9,Fadding that he then accepted he had
OL,10,F"got out on to the roof to try and get
OL,11,Faway from police, and accepts he took
OL,12,Fslates off".
OL,14,FThe lawyer acknowledged it was a
OL,15,F"difficult" bail application, but said
OL,16,Fthat with "appropriate and stringent
OL,17,Fconditions" the man could be
OL,18,Fappropriate for bail.
OL,26,@oD@NOUpD@dO]rD@AOUtD@KO]wD@AOUwD@KO]xD@
OL,26,AKOUyD@KO]
