OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785417510
OL,3,CBail refused for man accused over
OL,4,Crooftop stand-off with police
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Anne Marshall
OL,7,Fresponded: "You describe it as
OL,8,Fdifficult, I describe it as utterly
OL,9,Fimpossible.
OL,11,F"There are absolutely no circumstances
OL,12,Fwhatsoever that this man could be
OL,13,Fmanaged on bail.
OL,15,F"Bail is most firmly refused, risk of
OL,16,Freoffending being extremely high, risk
OL,17,Fof not turning up as well, and
OL,18,Fprobably a multitude of other reasons."
OL,20,FThe case is next to be mentioned on
OL,21,FAugust 27.
OL,26,@oD@LOUsD@AOUwD@AOUzD@gO]
